["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/glue", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "[GLobal Unique Enterprise (GLUE) Identifiers](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-spice-glue-id/), as defined by the IETF Internet-Draft, is expressed as a GLUE URI, a Uniform Resource Identifier that standardizes the representation of existing organizational entity identifiers.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
